  <h1>About Teach Direct</h1>
  <p class="content__intro">Teach Direct is a free, open-source app of scripted lessons a parent teaches from a phone. Every lesson is scripted, so a parent with no training can teach it well. Today it holds the math program, for children of four to seven. A reading program is being built on the same design.</p>

